  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You touch a willing creature. Until the spell ends, its skin hardens into a tortoise shell while it stays in place, giving it a +3 bonus to AC. If it moves by using its action, Bonus Action, Reaction, or movement, the bonus drops to +1 until the start of its next turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-qWXZ7GS9eTxbzNVC\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect gives +3; lower it to +1 by hand when the target moves.</p></section>",
